# Text files are checked out with LF line ends everywhere, also by Git for Windows
# (its default would turn them into CRLF, which breaks the Codex and Cursor skill rewrites).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
